⚡️🇮🇶 According to sources, quoting a senior source for the Iraqi News Agency, a number of suspects in corruption cases have been arrested "based on confessions made by the Deputy Minister of Oil, Adnan Al-Jumaili."

The arrests included members of the House of Representatives who had their immunity lifted, as well as officials whose names were mentioned in those confessions.

@medmannews

⚡️🇺🇸🇨🇦🇲🇽 The Trio organizers of this version of the World Cup, America, Canada, and Mexico, are still in the race.

Each one will play against a country from a different continent. One from Europe (Bosnia), one from Africa (South Africa), and one from South America (Ecuador).

